{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0099-s003", "text": "Studierna är indelade i studieperioder, och de studerande kan själva planera sin läsordning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0099-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.263153076171875, "generation_seconds": 21.71446527307853, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0099-s004", "text": "Största delen av studierna är obligatoriska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0099-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.300140380859375, "generation_seconds": 18.51896359701641, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0099-s005", "text": "Dessutom väljer den studerande studier enligt sina egna intressen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0099-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.265716552734375, "generation_seconds": 17.85835222201422, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0100-s001", "text": "Vanligtvis tar gymnasiestudierna tre år, men man kan också avlägga dess lärokurs långsammare eller snabbare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0100-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.34771728515625, "generation_seconds": 20.262727587949485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0100-s002", "text": "Studierna får i allmänhet inte ta mer än fyra år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0100-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.361572265625, "generation_seconds": 10.361334955086932, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0101-s001", "text": "I gymnasiet studerar man många olika läroämnen, till exempel modersmål och främmande språk, finska eller svenska som andraspråk, matematik, fysik, kemi, biologi, historia, religion eller livsåskådningskunskap, samhällslära, gymnastik, musik och bildkonst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0101-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 21.106938775510205, "peak": 0.386962890625, "generation_seconds": 42.29343017190695, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0102-s001", "text": "I gymnasiet får de studerande siffervitsord för de studieperioder de avlägger.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0102-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.238922119140625, "generation_seconds": 13.936131204944104, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0102-s002", "text": "Vitsordet visar hur väl den studerande har gått framåt under studieperioden och lärt sig nya saker.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014528403706+0000-2/hb-c08-u0102-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.284088134765625, "generation_seconds": 15.399407498072833, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
